{"4498850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RIPCORE", "steam_appid": 4498850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 CIRCLES. INFINITE HORDES. ONE SURVIVOR.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RIPCORE</strong> is an adrenaline-fueled roguelike FPS where the relentless action of 90s shooters meets the addictive chaos of modern survivor-likes. You are the last spark of life in the depths of the Abyss. Your goal is simple: descend through all 9 circles of Hell and tear its Lord to pieces.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/4ea303276c9ae9f7f29bb20519b5c803.poster.avif?t=1787245776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/4ea303276c9ae9f7f29bb20519b5c803.webm?t=1787245776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/4ea303276c9ae9f7f29bb20519b5c803.mp4?t=1787245776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORE GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KILL. COLLECT. EVOLVE.</strong> — Annihilate thousands of demons, gather experience, and choose from dozens of game-changing upgrades. With every level, you don’t just get stronger—you become a god of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNERGY IS KING</strong> — Stack sigils, artifacts, and weapon modifiers. Create a build that turns your rifle into a homing laser machine or a screen-clearing explosive nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM CALM TO INFERNAL</strong> — Adapt to the rising madness. The deeper you go, the higher the enemy density and the lower the margin for error.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/6e6efc44d8f655bbc701ebdc35448fc4.poster.avif?t=1787245776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/6e6efc44d8f655bbc701ebdc35448fc4.webm?t=1787245776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/6e6efc44d8f655bbc701ebdc35448fc4.mp4?t=1787245776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 Circles of Destruction:</strong> Unique biomes with distinct bosses and survival rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Build System:</strong> Crits, explosions, ricochets, and elemental auras—millions of combinations for every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rage Factor:</strong> Unleash your inner fury to literally tear through reality and your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Competition:</strong> Prove you are Hell's most efficient cleaner on the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/9b1bfedbb3c5eea9f012eb7c0186ac69.poster.avif?t=1787245776\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/9b1bfedbb3c5eea9f012eb7c0186ac69.webm?t=1787245776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498850/extras/9b1bfedbb3c5eea9f012eb7c0186ac69.mp4?t=1787245776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9 CIR